      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Case managers at the Daniel Freeman Memorial Hospital in Inglewood, CA, planned a \"celebration of success\" earlier this year to highlight their accomplishments. Individual critical pathways teams presented data for their different areas, such as orthopedics and cardiac surgery. Team members were able to educate staff about their efforts and show off their accomplishments to administrators. It was so successful, that another celebration is planned for next year."},
